<title>GERMANY: Sixt says plans five-yr,200 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Sixt says plans five-yr,200 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car rental group Sixt AG said on Wednesday that it planned to issue a 200 million mark bond with a maturity of five years.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate in the statement, which was issued ahead of a presentation in Frankfurt later today.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
